{"Risk of race conditions when updating retryCount - concurrent cron executions might both try to increment retryCount; should use atomic increment instead of reading and writing back": 0.8719561696052551, "Deletion condition unintentionally applies to all methods - the deleteMany where clause's retryCount branch does not restrict to SMS, so any WorkflowReminder of any method with retryCount > 1 will be deleted": 0.9814832806587219, "Logging should include reminder.id and retryCount for easier debugging when errors occur": 0.22087863087654114, "Missing logging when retryCount is incremented and when a reminder is deleted due to retryCount threshold": 0.18689778447151184, "Missing unit/integration tests for: scheduling fails once (retryCount increments to 1), scheduling fails twice (retryCount increments to 2 and reminder removed), and ensuring other reminder methods are not deleted when retryCount > 1": 0.5395135283470154, "Consider adding an index on retryCount if deleting by retryCount frequently": 0.14102499186992645}